 >>[2026-07-22 16:30] surprise — parallel work (external agent, uncommitted) landed mid-plan: differential.ts now defines EpistemicGrade as 'epistemic.l0.fact' | 'epistemic.l1.score' | 'epistemic.l2.report' (resolves ?[epistemic-grade-name] — matches the effect.l* pattern, not my draft e0/e1/e2 candidate). New files packages/spw-seed/src/canonical/range-transform.ts (345 lines, implements commit 3), packages/spw-seed/src/canonical/index-config.ts (94 lines, implements commit 5), packages/spw-seed/src/math/idioms.ts (112 lines, algorithmic-idiom binding table). form-ladders.ts, grammar/containers.ts, normalize.ts, types/ast/nodes.ts also modified (likely commit 2/4 territory).
