 >>[2026-07-22 16:45] decide — user chose: fix the 3 compile-error groups, verify, stop there. Treated parallel work's epistemic-grade naming (epistemic.l0.fact/l1.score/l2.report) and range-transform.ts/index-config.ts as authoritative rather than re-planning around them.
