 >>[2026-07-22 16:56] note — git stash mishap during verification touched two OLD unrelated stash entries (grok-working-tree-before-reconciliation-merge-2026-07-21, safety-checkpoint-a333-payload-before-partition) but nothing was lost; both remain in `git stash list` untouched. Avoid `git stash push --  <specific files>` when any of them are untracked (fails the whole push silently-ish); use `git stash push -u` or commit/copy-aside instead next time.
